{"unit_id":"ZeaoZhang__dsh-browser-control#card-zh","repo":"ZeaoZhang/dsh-browser-control","commit":"43f937b3bfbf92193ff76b56aa6c0dfaa9ee87be","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-control 是 DSH 的 Chrome 浏览器控制插件。它启动本机 WebSocket/HTTP 服务，通过 Chrome MV3 扩展连接浏览器，并向 DSH 注册九个 browser_* 工具。用户可扫描并裁剪网页可见内容、执行页面 JavaScript、等待页面状态、操作网页元素和管理标签页，也可上传下载文件、截图或调用 CDP。适合需要让 DSH 会话浏览网页、操作界面或检查页面状态的场景。使用时需安装并启用配套扩展，并让扩展与插件使用相同端口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-60","lib/tools.js:139-146","lib/driver.js:81-89","extension/manifest.json:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"ZeaoZhang__dsh-browser-control#card-en","repo":"ZeaoZhang/dsh-browser-control","commit":"43f937b3bfbf92193ff76b56aa6c0dfaa9ee87be","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-browser-control connects a Chrome extension to DSH with nine browser_* tools. Sessions can scan pages, run JavaScript, wait for states, interact with elements, manage tabs, transfer files, capture screenshots, and call CDP. Install the extension with a matching port.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-60","lib/tools.js:139-146","lib/driver.js:81-89","extension/manifest.json:1-20"]}
